<p local-id=3D"6ba6025d2e18">Semantics: as per use case</p>
<p local-id=3D"60cd71de9439">Analysis: note use of .B to signal these are e=
xceptions to regular bag process</p>
<p local-id=3D"1f43f58fd436">In mapping we run a bit into an issue. Baggage=
 Status is treated as a state indicated by handler, not as a =E2=80=9Crecon=
ciled=E2=80=9D state tracked by custodian. BCM-FMM expresses the baggage st=
ate as known to custodian. So, that does not flow nicely</p>
<p local-id=3D"22c644556908">Result</p>
<ul local-id=3D"df1d6a0d7ec1">
<li local-id=3D"fd507137aa35">
<p local-id=3D"2a6832ebcdaa"><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://iat=
aonline.sharepoint.com/:u:/r/sites/IATABaggageWorkingGroup/Shared%20Documen=
ts/Baggage%20Information%20Exchange%20(BIX)%20Sub%20Group/Taskforce%20best%=
20practices%20BIX%20v2/Samples/source%20RP1745/8.7.4.9.1.a%20Example%20of%2=
0the%20Final%20Match%20Message.xml?d=3Dwba7bbaef577a45dea51fe6cda0a4aad0&am=
p;csf=3D1&amp;web=3D1&amp;e=3DMY0Eqw" rel=3D"nofollow">8.7.4.9.1.a Example =
of the Final Match Message</a></p>
</li>
</ul>
